  "details": "I think VRChat should invest time into a AI optimization tool with would automatically optimize the mesh and all the other components, till they get at least to a medium rating on avatars. Even maybe provide a GUI showing the Avatars rating.\n\nThe other option of Unity AI optimization tool is a assistant mode to pick up; on the possible mistakes or show possible optimization paths, without removing any features [Dances,clothing, etc.] from the avatar.\n\nThis would really improve the game experience and optimize the game.\n\nA lot of peoples experience lags do to very poor or poor avatars and there are a lot of them. \n\nYet, instead having fallbacks and feeling left out, by disabling avatars. \n\nIt would be better to provide such a tool.",
